  "text": "Wednesday, October 7, 2026 | 10:30 AM – 7:30 PM\nMetropolis Country Club\n289 Dobbs Ferry Rd\nWhite Plains, NY 10607\n\nJoin us on Wednesday, October 7, 2026 for our Annual Golf Outing!\nDon’t miss out on a day of golfing under the sun, networking and connecting with industry professionals, dinner at the prestigious Metropolis Country Club, and a chance to win some amazing prizes at our raffle! You can help make our raffle prizes even better by donating. Contact Margie at margie@buildersinstitute.org if your business or organization would like to make a prize donation!\nTentative Schedule (subject to change closer to the date)\n10:30 am to 12:00 noon — Registration and breakfast buffet\n12:15 noon — Shotgun start\n12:30 pm — Lunch available at the Halfway House\n5:00 pm — Cocktail reception\n6:00 pm — Dinner and prize raffle\nREGISTER HERE!",
